      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the info. i'm a bit worried about the back thing though... i've heard that back pain can mean it's getting into the kidneys. if i do the oregano oil and cranberry like you said, how much should i be taking to be really sure it's enough to kill the infection? i'm thinking like, maybe like 10-15 capsules of the oil a day to be safe? i really just want to handle this at home so i don't have to spend a bunch of money at urgent care.",
      "source": "evaluator"
